cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Genesis in research, please cite it as below and state the version or commit you used."
title: "Genesis: an autonomous world of learning creatures"
abstract: "An open-source simulation of an Earth-like world in which creatures with their own neural networks learn by reinforcement, reproduce and evolve, with nothing about their behaviour scripted. Runs without a browser, is exactly repeatable from a seed, and includes an experiment runner."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Sen
    given-names: Malvika
version: 0.7.0
date-released: 2026-11-08
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/malvika123/genesis"
url: "https://malvika123.github.io/genesis/"
keywords:
  - artificial life
  - agent-based model
  - reinforcement learning
  - open-endedness
  - early human behaviour
